 <h2>1. About CoreFlow Rx</h2>
 <p>CoreFlow Rx is a specialty infusion pharmacy serving prescribing providers and their patients. These Terms govern your use of coreflowrx.com and our messaging programs.</p>
 <p>CoreFlow Rx accepts referrals and orders only from licensed physicians and other providers eligible to prescribe infusion therapy. A valid physician order is required before CoreFlow Rx can provide services.</p>

 <h2>2. Use of this website</h2>
 <p>This site is provided for informational purposes and to allow licensed providers to submit patient referrals. Nothing on this site is medical advice, a diagnosis, or a treatment recommendation for any individual. Patients should direct clinical questions to their prescribing provider.</p>
 <p>Availability of a therapy on this site does not guarantee that CoreFlow Rx can service a particular referral. Coverage, formulary status, and clinical suitability are confirmed case by case.</p>

 <h2>3. SMS Messaging Terms</h2>

 <h3>Program name</h3>
 <p><strong>CoreFlow Rx Patient &amp; Provider Notifications</strong></p>

 <h3>Program description</h3>
 <p>CoreFlow Rx operates two related messaging programs under this name:</p>
 <p><strong>Patient notifications.</strong> Patients who provide their mobile number receive appointment and infusion-related messages — scheduling confirmations, infusion appointment reminders, nurse visit windows, and changes to a scheduled visit.</p>
 <p><strong>Provider office notifications.</strong> Staff at referring provider offices who provide a mobile number receive status updates on referrals they have submitted — referral received, benefits verification in progress, prior authorization status, and ready-to-schedule notifications.</p>
 <p>These are transactional and service-related messages tied to care already in progress. <strong>We do not send marketing or promotional text messages.</strong></p>

 <h3>How you enroll</h3>
 <p>You are enrolled only when you affirmatively provide your mobile number and agree to receive text messages — on a referral form, an intake or registration form, or by giving verbal consent to a CoreFlow Rx staff member, which we document.</p>
 <p><strong>Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of receiving services from CoreFlow Rx.</strong> If you prefer not to receive text messages, we will contact you by phone.</p>

 <h3>Message frequency</h3>
 <p>Message frequency varies based on your care or referral activity. Patients typically receive 2–6 messages per month. Provider offices typically receive 1–5 messages per referral submitted.</p>

 <h3>Message and data rates</h3>
 <p><strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Your mobile carrier's standard messaging and data charges apply to messages you send and receive. CoreFlow Rx does not charge for this service.</p>

 <h3>How to get help</h3>
 <p><strong>Text HELP</strong> to the number you received the message from, and we will reply with support information.</p>
 <p>You can also reach us at <strong>{{ site.phone }}</strong> or <strong><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></strong>, {{ site.hours }}.</p>

 <h3>How to opt out</h3>
 <p><strong>Text STOP</strong> to the number you received the message from at any time. You will receive one confirmation message and no further texts from that program.</p>
 <p>To rejoin, text <strong>START</strong> to the same number, or contact us at <strong>{{ site.phone }}</strong>.</p>
 <p><strong>Opting out of text messages does not affect your care.</strong> We will continue to reach you by phone about your treatment.</p>

 <h3>Supported carriers and delivery</h3>
 <p>This service is available on most major U.S. mobile carriers. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Message delivery is subject to your carrier's network and to transmission conditions outside our control.</p>
 <p><strong>Do not rely on text messaging for urgent or emergency matters.</strong> For a medical emergency, call 911. For urgent clinical questions, call <strong>{{ site.phone }}</strong> or contact your prescribing provider.</p>

 <h3>Privacy</h3>
 <p>Your mobile number and messaging consent are handled as described in our <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>. <strong>No mobile information is shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong></p>

 <h2>4. Changes to these terms</h2>
 <p>We may update these Terms. Material changes will be reflected in the effective date above, and continued use of the site or messaging programs after a change constitutes acceptance.</p>

